WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.677
- I don't feel like I deserve nice crisps.

00:00:01.677 --> 00:00:02.222
- Yeah.

00:00:10.012 --> 00:00:12.086
- They're possibly slightly glittery.

00:00:12.086 --> 00:00:13.436
- Is there stars on them?

00:00:13.436 --> 00:00:14.841
- Oh my god there's stars!

00:00:14.841 --> 00:00:15.696
- That's mad.

00:00:16.966 --> 00:00:18.440
- Wow, they taste a bit like a bath bomb.

00:00:18.440 --> 00:00:19.914
- That's just all sugar isn't it?

00:00:19.914 --> 00:00:21.795
- They're like fizzing on my
tongue, put it on your tongue.

00:00:21.795 --> 00:00:23.896
- Maybe like a nice fizz, like Skips.

00:00:23.896 --> 00:00:25.057
- Prosecco and gammon.

00:00:25.057 --> 00:00:25.893
- Maybe a bellini?

00:00:25.893 --> 00:00:27.437
- Champagne crisps or some shit.

00:00:27.437 --> 00:00:29.411
I bet someone's put like
fucking berries in it.

00:00:29.411 --> 00:00:31.042
- Yay!

00:00:31.952 --> 00:00:35.050
Although winter berries, what
the hell is a winter berry?

00:00:35.050 --> 00:00:36.956
- It actually has dried prosecco wine in.

00:00:36.956 --> 00:00:38.725
- It's pretty sweet, it's
a bit like a dessert crisp.

00:00:38.725 --> 00:00:40.834
- I would like to replace
after eight mints with these.

00:00:45.304 --> 00:00:46.675
- It smells like an old pub.

00:00:47.815 --> 00:00:48.635
- Facon.

00:00:48.635 --> 00:00:49.715
- Facon.

00:00:49.715 --> 00:00:52.269
- OK so we gotta go beef, sage, and gravy.

00:00:52.269 --> 00:00:53.678
- [Lady on right] It's fishy.
- Maybe it's like a seafood.

00:00:53.678 --> 00:00:55.096
Seafood and lemon.

00:00:55.726 --> 00:00:56.268
- Oh--

00:00:56.268 --> 00:00:56.970
- Scampi.

00:00:56.970 --> 00:00:57.569
- Yep.

00:00:57.569 --> 00:00:58.540
- (laughs)

00:00:58.540 --> 00:00:59.941
- Not really meat.

00:00:59.941 --> 00:01:01.231
- We were wrong on everything.

00:01:01.231 --> 00:01:01.811
- What?

00:01:01.811 --> 00:01:02.961
- That's posh as fuck.

00:01:02.961 --> 00:01:03.611
- Ya, ya, ya.

00:01:03.611 --> 00:01:05.235
- Logically these should be
closer to like prawn cocktail

00:01:05.235 --> 00:01:06.912
and these are not prawn cocktail.

00:01:10.922 --> 00:01:11.687
These are good.

00:01:11.687 --> 00:01:12.608
They've got like a little bit of

00:01:12.608 --> 00:01:13.687
what looks like dirt on them.

00:01:13.687 --> 00:01:15.533
- Smoky lemon flavour? (laughs)

00:01:15.533 --> 00:01:16.427
- Smoked lemons.

00:01:16.427 --> 00:01:17.507
- They're mint and lamb.

00:01:17.507 --> 00:01:19.666
- I think this is like a
fancy roast chicken one.

00:01:19.666 --> 00:01:22.695
- It smells a bit like the
lamb cat food my cats eat.

00:01:22.695 --> 00:01:24.228
- [Lady on right] Yes.
- Yay!

00:01:24.228 --> 00:01:26.631
- Admit that it's just
basically fancy kebab though.

00:01:26.631 --> 00:01:28.431
- I mean if these were in a
large glass bowl at a party

00:01:28.431 --> 00:01:29.348
I'd be pretty impressed.

00:01:29.348 --> 00:01:32.318
- But it's not just any
lamb, it's salt marsh lamb.

00:01:32.318 --> 00:01:33.786
- I'm quite in to baby sheep now.

00:01:37.706 --> 00:01:38.855
- It looks like potpourri.

00:01:38.855 --> 00:01:40.118
- Parsnip crisps.

00:01:40.118 --> 00:01:41.334
- Possibly cassava?

00:01:41.334 --> 00:01:43.092
- I don't know what that is.
- [Man on left] Or plantain?

00:01:43.092 --> 00:01:44.149
- How could you eat that?

00:01:44.149 --> 00:01:45.472
- You couldn't eat that
with any sort of dignity.

00:01:45.472 --> 00:01:47.504
- It smells quite like perfume-y.

00:01:47.504 --> 00:01:48.711
- They're mad sweet,

00:01:48.711 --> 00:01:50.105
that's like the sweetest
thing I've ever had.

00:01:50.105 --> 00:01:51.544
- It tastes like burnt caramel.

00:01:51.544 --> 00:01:53.390
- Bacon glazed parsnip.

00:01:53.390 --> 00:01:57.771
- Dill and honey parsnips with
truffle oil, I don't know!

00:01:57.771 --> 00:02:00.817
Maple and pancetta parsnip crisps.

00:02:00.817 --> 00:02:02.085
- Literally no pancetta in that.

00:02:02.085 --> 00:02:05.185
- If bacon is pancetta
and honey was maple,

00:02:05.185 --> 00:02:06.752
we've got this spot on.
- Do you know what we've done?

00:02:06.752 --> 00:02:08.923
- We've done a kind of
like keeping it real

00:02:08.923 --> 00:02:10.444
English version of this.

00:02:10.524 --> 00:02:13.187
- This is a smoky bacon
crisp done horribly wrong.

00:02:13.187 --> 00:02:15.311
- Whoever was supposed
to put in the pancetta

00:02:15.311 --> 00:02:16.851
has just fucked it off,
they've gone found a pub.

00:02:16.851 --> 00:02:21.120
- It's opened my eyes to
the bourgeois crisp world.

00:02:21.120 --> 00:02:21.760
- Ya.

00:02:21.760 --> 00:02:24.171
- Posh scampi or the
posh roast I quite like.

00:02:24.171 --> 00:02:26.081
- Instead of handing around the gold balls

00:02:26.081 --> 00:02:27.279
and the Ferrero Rocher,

00:02:27.279 --> 00:02:29.599
they hand round some prosecco crisps.

00:02:36.869 --> 00:02:37.644
- Hi.

00:02:38.064 --> 00:02:38.747
- Hello.

00:02:38.747 --> 00:02:39.408
- Hey guys!

00:02:40.108 --> 00:02:41.342
- [All] Sarah!

00:02:41.342 --> 00:02:42.008
- Up here.

00:02:42.558 --> 00:02:43.506
- We made a series.

00:02:43.506 --> 00:02:45.274
- It's coming on November 18th.

00:02:45.274 --> 00:02:46.385
- Please watch it.

00:02:46.385 --> 00:02:48.162
- Get it here. Over here.

00:02:48.162 --> 00:02:48.998
- There, over there.

00:02:48.998 --> 00:02:49.824
- You got it.

00:02:49.824 --> 00:02:50.681
- I think they got it, OK.

00:02:50.681 --> 00:02:51.525
- I'm out.

00:02:51.525 --> 00:02:52.619
- OK bye

00:02:52.619 --> 00:02:56.299
- It will be released 2015, November, OK.

